{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873360/extras/07cf7e327fe07462f53127134c644302.avif?t=1774348925\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chumaky</strong> is a game where you go on exciting journeys between authentic  villages. Trade with villagers, complete quests, and explore mysterious places. Grow your farm, find new trade routes \u2014 but be careful: night travels might attract creatures from old legends...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873360/extras/7a1d48c8c890e030f8379ae289bea262.avif?t=1774348925\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873360/extras/98694587c1c1e5c8d3af0a8b1a8b31f0.poster.avif?t=1774348925\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873360/extras/98694587c1c1e5c8d3af0a8b1a8b31f0.webm?t=1774348925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873360/extras/98694587c1c1e5c8d3af0a8b1a8b31f0.mp4?t=1774348925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load up your wagon with goods and set off on scenic journeys between villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873360/extras/f4f5bb131da1fbace91c25554ec6a39b.avif?t=1774348925\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https